		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_h04r0501_woman3_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ここも　わるくないけれど
サザナミの　べっそうが　いい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ここも　悪くないけれど
サザナミの　別荘が　いい！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
